## ENFORCEMENT RULE  
If the user asks Cursor to generate any file, Cursor must **place it in the correct folder path automatically** and must not place files outside the structure above.

If the user provides a file name only, Cursor must infer the path based on this rule.

### Examples:

**Generate login test case:**
```
tests/e2e/login/
  ├── cases/
  │   └── login-successful/
  │       ├── test.spec.ts
  │       ├── test-data.json
  │       └── scenario.md
  └── shared-data.json
```

**Generate API test case:**
```
tests/api/user-management/
  ├── cases/
  │   └── create-user/
  │       ├── test.spec.ts
  │       ├── test-data.json
  │       └── scenario.md
  └── shared-data.json
```

**Generate login page object:**
```
src/pages/login-page.ts
```

**Generate login fixture:**
```
src/fixtures/login.fixture.ts
```

**Generate Excel result writer utility:**
```
src/utils/excel-result-writer.ts
```

**Generate API client:**
```
src/api/user-api.ts
```

